can still safely change Title or (better) translate it using Localizer','Account Type','ERP5 Base Category','Base Category',NULL,NULL,NULL,'embedded',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3625,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Invoice Transaction Line','portal_types/Sale Invoice Transaction Line',541,'Sale Invoice Transaction Line','Those lines belong to Sale Invoice Transactions and can be generated either when the related Sales Packing List is delivered, or by the accountant manually. Those lines will generate the accounting transaction lines of the accounting transaction.','Sale Invoice Transaction Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3626,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Invoice Transaction','portal_types/Sale Invoice Transaction',541,'Sale Invoice Transaction','A Sale Invoice Transaction combines in the same document a customer invoice and the accounting transaction deriving from it. Sale Invoice Transactions are normally generated automatically by ERP5 simulation from delivered Sale Packing Lists or groups thereof. They may also be entered by human intervention to fit specific invoicing cases. Accounting transaction lines are generated automatically out of invoice lines through business rules yet can be modified by accountants to fit specific accounting cases.','Sale Invoice Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3627,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Invoice Transaction Line','portal_types/Purchase Invoice Transaction Line',541,'Purchase Invoice Transaction Line','Those lines belong to Purchase Invoice Transactions and can be generated either when the related Sales Packing List is delivered, or by the accountant manually. Those lines will generate the accounting transaction lines of the accounting transaction.','Purchase Invoice Transaction Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3628,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Invoice Transaction','portal_types/Purchase Invoice Transaction',541,'Purchase Invoice Transaction','A Purchase Invoice Transaction combines in the same document a supplier invoice and the accounting transaction deriving from it. Purchase Invoice Transactions are normally generated automatically by ERP5 simulation from delivered Purchase Packing Lists or groups thereof and are set in planned state. Upon reception of a paper invoice, it is the task of the accountant to match it to an expected invoice in planned state or to enter it manually. Accounting transaction lines are generated automatically out of invoice lines through business rules yet can be modified by accountants to fit specific accounting cases.','Purchase Invoice Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3629,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Payment Transaction','portal_types/Payment Transaction',541,'Payment Transaction','Incoming payment and outgoing payment transactions that can be done from the accounting module.','Payment Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3630,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Payment Simulation Rule','portal_types/Payment Simulation Rule',541,'Payment Simulation Rule','Payment Simulation Rule object make sure an Payment in the simulation is consistent with the real payment.','Payment Simulation Rule','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3631,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Invoice Root Simulation Rule','portal_types/Invoice Root Simulation Rule',541,'Invoice Root Simulation Rule','Invoice Root Simulation Rule object makes sure an Invoice in the simulation is consistent with the real invoice.','Invoice Root Simulation Rule','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3632,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Invoice Transaction Line','portal_types/Internal Invoice Transaction Line',541,'Internal Invoice Transaction Line','Those lines belong to Purchase Invoice Transactions and can be generated either when the related Sales Packing List is delivered, or by the accountant manually. Those lines will generate the accounting transaction lines of the accounting transaction.','Internal Invoice Transaction Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3633,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Invoice Transaction','portal_types/Internal Invoice Transaction',541,'Internal Invoice Transaction','A Purchase Invoice Transaction combines in the same document a supplier invoice and the accounting transaction deriving from it. Purchase Invoice Transactions are normally generated automatically by ERP5 simulation from delivered Purchase Packing Lists or groups thereof and are set in planned state. Upon reception of a paper invoice, it is the task of the accountant to match it to an expected invoice in planned state or to enter it manually. Accounting transaction lines are generated automatically out of invoice lines through business rules yet can be modified by accountants to fit specific accounting cases.','Internal Invoice Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3634,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Cash Register','portal_types/Cash Register',541,'Cash Register','A machine that tabulates the amount of sales transactions, makes a permanent and cumulative record of them, and has a drawer in which cash can be kept.','Cash Register','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3635,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Balance Transaction Line','portal_types/Balance Transaction Line',541,'Balance Transaction Line','Line of Balance Transaction','Balance Transaction Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3636,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Balance Transaction','portal_types/Balance Transaction',541,'Balance Transaction','Balance Transaction','Balance Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3637,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Transaction Root Simulation Rule','portal_types/Accounting Transaction Root Simulation Rule',541,'Accounting Transaction Root Simulation Rule','Accounting Transaction Root Simulation Rule object makes sure an Accounting Transaction in the simulation is consistent with the real accounting transaction.','Accounting Transaction Root Simulation Rule','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3638,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Transaction Module','portal_types/Accounting Transaction Module',541,'Accounting Transaction Module',' Holds Accounting Transaction objects','Accounting Transaction Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3639,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Transaction Line','portal_types/Accounting Transaction Line',541,'Accounting Transaction Line','Accounting transaction lines are generated either from invoice lines, or created manually by the accountant. Each line correspond to a credit or debit of a specific account for a given transaction, for instance, a sale invoice transaction will most of the time have 3 accounting lines: 1 for the client account, one for the sold goods account, and one for the VAT account.','Accounting Transaction Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3640,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Transaction Balance Constraint','portal_types/Accounting Transaction Balance Constraint',541,'Accounting Transaction Balance Constraint','An Accounting Transaction Balance Constraint checks whether accounting transaction total debit and total credit are equal','Accounting Transaction Balance Constraint','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3641,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Transaction','portal_types/Accounting Transaction',541,'Accounting Transaction','An accounting transaction, created from scratch by the accountant or whoever entitled to create transactions in ERP5','Accounting Transaction','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3642,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Accounting Period','portal_types/Accounting Period',541,'Accounting Period','Mark the beginning and the end of an Accounting Period.\nOnce the period is closed (i.e. the Accounting Period Delimiter is in delivered state), it is no longer possible to validate Transaction in this period','Accounting Period','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3643,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Account Type Constraint Line','portal_types/Account Type Constraint Line',541,'Account Type Constraint Line','A Category Existence Constraint checks whether an object contains the given categories without or with Acquisition','Account Type Constraint Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:31','2020-08-03 05:57:18'),(3644,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Account Type Constraint','portal_types/Account Type Constraint',541,'Account Type Constraint','A Category Existence Constraint checks whether an object contains the given categories without or with Acquisition','Account Type Constraint','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL