g properties, with configuration caps equivalences. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.','String Divergence Tester','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3804,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Specialise Divergence Tester','portal_types/Specialise Divergence Tester',541,'Specialise Divergence Tester','','Specialise Divergence Tester','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3805,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Type','portal_types/Solver Type',541,'Solver Type','An abstract Portal Type which is useful to generate Solvers (ex. Target Solvers) and to keep all common properties in a central place. Solver properties include various user interface information, configuration forms, and possibly properties which help to find out incompatible divergence resolution decisions.','Solver Type','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3808,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Process Tool','portal_types/Solver Process Tool',541,'Solver Process Tool','Solver Process Tool contains Solver Processes','Solver Process Tool','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3809,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Process','portal_types/Solver Process',541,'Solver Process','A Solver Process is a document which stored a collection of solver decisions and provides a persistency area to solvers which are in charge of implementing the decision.','Solver Process','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3810,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Decision','portal_types/Solver Decision',541,'Solver Decision','A Solver Decision defines which delivery movements are solved using which solvers. Solver Dcision will support all property sheets which are supported also by a Target Solver, so that it can hold decision information.\r\n','Solver Decision','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3811,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','portal_types/Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester',541,'Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','Net Converted Quantity Divergence Testers can be used to test net converted quantity, taking into account margins and rounding. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.','Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:53:16','2020-08-03 05:57:17'),(3812,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Float Divergence Tester','portal_types/Float Divergence Tester',541,'Float Divergence Tester','Float Divergence Testers can be used to test float properties, taking into account margins and rounding. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.','Float Divergence Tester','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,