er. This is practical for the user, because it allows not to loose time typing the same information again and again.','Internal Trade Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:54:20','2020-08-03 05:57:19'),(7010,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Packing List Module','portal_types/Internal Packing List Module',541,'Internal Packing List Module','Contains Internal Packing List','Internal Packing List Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:54:20','2020-08-03 05:57:19'),(7011,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Packing List Line','portal_types/Internal Packing List Line',541,'Internal Packing List Line','A Product object holds the information about\r\na manufactured product, like a pen, a bicycle...','Internal Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:54:20','2020-08-03 05:57:19'),(7012,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Packing List Cell','portal_types/Internal Packing List Cell',541,'Internal Packing List Cell','      A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities\r\n      for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.\r\n','Internal Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:54:20','2020-08-03 05:57:19'),(7013,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Packing List','portal_types/Internal Packing List',541,'Internal Packing List','A Product object holds the information about\na manufactured product, like a pen, a bicycle...','Internal Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','De