ducts, version of business templates, existence of certain tools, configuration of certain tools, etc.\n\nIf all alarms are in OK state, it is considered as a proof that the upgrade process went well from an instance maintenance point of view (but it does not prove that the upgrade process produces working instances).','erp5_upgrader','ERP5 Business Template','Business Template',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:56:57','2020-08-03 05:57:01','2020-08-03 05:57:36'),(14468,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/variation_tester','portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/variation_tester',14500,'variation_tester','','variation divergence tester','ERP5 Variation Divergence Tester','Variation Divergence Tester',NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'default_order_rule',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:56:56','2020-08-03 05:57:36'),(14469,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/use_tester','portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/use_tester',14500,'use_tester','','use divergence tester','ERP5 Category Membership Equivalence Tester','Category Membership Divergence Tester',NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'default_order_rule',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:56:56','2020-08-03 05:57:36'),(14470,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/stop_date_tester','portal_rules/new_order_root_simulation_rule/stop_date_tester',14500,'stop_date_tester','','stop_date divergence tester','ERP5 DateTime Equivalence Tester','DateTime Divergence Tester',NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'default_order_rule',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-03 05:56:56','2020-08-03 05:57:36'),(14471,6,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_r