s for each variation of a resource in a order line.'),(12315,'A Manufacturing Order allows for entering manufacturing order information, actors involved in an order, payment conditions, ordered products or services, quantity, price, etc. It also allows to choose supply chain defining the production process and. It follows a standard production order workflow which represents the maturity of an order from prospect to confirmation. Once an order is confirmed, it can not be modified.'),(12316,'Holds Manufacturing Executions'),(12317,'Manufacturing Execution Line defines quantity, prices, dates of resource that has to be consumed/produced.'),(12318,'A Packing Report Cell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a packing list line.'),(12319,'A Manufacturing Execution allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been produced or consumed during production. Manufacturing Executions directly impact the inventory.'),(12322,'ProductionSimulationRule'),(12324,'erp5_mrp Business template for Production'),(12346,'Web Page'),(12368,'Web Illustration'),(12372,'PDF'),(12396,'Document'),(12419,'Document'),(12618,'Production Packing List'),(12629,'Production Packing List'),(12644,'Production Packing List Line'),(12648,'Production Order Planning'),(12652,'Operations'),(12656,'Print Production Order'),(12662,'Materials'),(12689,'Production Order'),(12702,'Production Order'),(12704,'Production Order Module Planning'),(12722,'Production Order Line'),(12729,'Stock'),(12760,'Manufacturing Order'),(12766,'Manufacturing Order'),(12768,'Planning'),(12790,'Manufacturing Execution'),(12798,'Manufacturing Execution'),(12814,'Manufacturing Execution Line'),(12857,'MRP Field Library'),(12859,'Production Order Module Specialise Domain'),(12860,'variant_movement_group_on_cell'),(12861,'property_movement_group_on_delivery'),(12862,'order_movement_group_on_delivery'),(12863,'category_movement_group_on_line'),(12864,'category_movement_group_on_delivery'),(